      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand what needs to be improved.Now I understand the test. It parses an 8-byte array representing two ZIP extra fields — the first parses cleanly (header=0x0000, data-length=0), and the second has a length that overruns the buffer (0xFA00 = 64000 bytes claimed), so `ONLY_PARSEABLE_STRICT` discards it, leaving exactly 1 result. Let me write a clearer version.The improved test compiled successfully."
